{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04793","headline":"喜度岭 · 张说","name":"喜度岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东汉兴唐历，南河复禹谋。\n宁知瘴疠地，生入帝皇州。\n雷雨苏虫蛰，春阳放鷽鸠。\n洄沿炎海畔，登降闽山陬。\n岭路分中夏，川源得上流。\n见花便独笑，看草即忘忧。\n自始居重译，天星已再周。\n乡关绝归望，亲戚不相求。\n弃杖枯还植，穷鳞涸更浮。\n道消黄鹤去，运啓白驹留。\n江妾晨炊黍，津童夜櫂舟。\n盛明良可遇，莫後洛城游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}